{
  "title": "Nourishing Greek Zucchini Horiatiki Salad",
  "description": "A rich and romantic Greek dish featuring zucchini and a blend of fresh ingredients, served in a tagliere vessel. This salad is perfect for a light and refreshing meal.",
  "cuisine": "Greek",
  "diet": [
